                                "sense_id": "8351d706-8b21-3520-81aa-64866c3391d4",
                                "text": "City felt they were victims of an injustice after 16 minutes when Silva's free-kick floated straight in, but French official Stephane Lannoy adjudged that Joleon Lescott had fouled keeper Jorg Butt."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbe913cc-d3ab-338d-b700-1806102bf133",
                        "entry_id": "4d7f59ae-dd1b-3b12-97ca-526a4d2b8881",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To award judicially; to assign."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
