                                "sense_id": "9a08831e-3905-389b-8fda-4d855a93f626",
                                "text": "on failure of payment of the fines adjudged against them […] for which he shall be so adjudged to imprisonment"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a600f4c2-49d6-47c2-8910-8b8d4eda58f2",
                                "sense_id": "9a08831e-3905-389b-8fda-4d855a93f626",
                                "text": "no man ought to be adjudged to death, but by the Laws established in this your Realm"
